{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HBLbupg1cL4m41YehYAngu","type":"tool_result","content":"# gray_counter\n\nA 4-bit Gray-code counter.\n\n## Ports\n| Port    | Dir | Width | Description |\n|---------|-----|-------|-------------|\n| clk     | in  | 1     | Rising-edge clock |\n| rst_n   | in  | 1     | Asynchronous active-low reset |\n| en      | in  | 1     | Count enable |\n| gray    | out | 4     | Current count, Gray-encoded (registered) |\n\n## Behavior\n- While `rst_n` is low, the internal binary count and `gray` are 0.\n- On each rising edge of `clk` with `en` high, the internal binary count increments by 1\n  (wrapping 15 -> 0) and `gray` takes the Gray encoding of the *new* binary count:\n  `gray = bin ^ (bin >> 1)`.\n- When `en` is low, the count and `gray` hold their values.\n- Consecutive outputs therefore differ in exactly one bit.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1b69e15c-ad09-437c-bdd4-302c22f8bdfc","uuid":"a9d35252-228a-4868-a7dc-5f77f9ada4ec","timestamp":"2026-10-19T23:42:50.834Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# gray_counter\n\nA 4-bit Gray-code counter.\n\n## Ports\n| Port    | Dir | Width | Description |\n|---------|-----|-------|-------------|\n| clk     | in  | 1     | Rising-edge clock |\n| rst_n   | in  | 1     | Asynchronous active-low reset |\n| en      | in  | 1     | Count enable |\n| gray    | out | 4     | Current count, Gray-encoded (registered) |\n\n## Behavior\n- While `rst_n` is low, the internal binary count and `gray` are 0.\n- On each rising edge of `clk` with `en` high, the internal binary count increments by 1\n  (wrapping 15 -> 0) and `gray` takes the Gray encoding of the *new* binary count:\n  `gray = bin ^ (bin >> 1)`.\n- When `en` is low, the count and `gray` hold their values.\n- Consecutive outputs therefore differ in exactly one bit.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
